 Note that some entries in $T_2$ and $T_4$ have not been simplified to be makes it clear that $\rank(T_i)\leq 1$. It is not difficult to verify that $T=T_{1}+T_{2}+T_{3}+T_{4}+T_{5}$, proving the result.
