+        "real matrix and performs n rational nullspace eliminations in O(n^4), "
+        "measured at 10,201,600 exact operations and 34.13 seconds at n=64, "
+        "while the signed-XOR change of variables uses 255 exact class/sign "
+        "comparisons and is not a mechanical in-context eigensolve."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 92,
+}
